title: Judiciary Reform
new-page: true
is-card: true
view-if: kcp_in_government = 1 and judiciary_timer = 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; judiciary_timer += 6
card-image: img/kcp_judiciary.png
tags: govt_affairs, cabinet

= Judiciary Reform

The Judiciary is independent from the goverment officialy however with control of the goverment and legislature we are able to change the laws on which it operates and thus influence it.

- @reform: Carry out substantial judicial reforms.
- @minor_reforms: Carry out minor judicial reforms.
- @as_is: Leave the judiciary as it is.
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@reform
subtitle: -1 budget
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough budget.
choose-if: budget >= 1
on-arrival: budget -= 1; democratization += 2; coalition_dissent += 1 if in_grand_coalition == 1; workers_kcp += 5*(1-dissent) if democratization >= 3; judicial_reform += 2; pro_republic += 5*(1-dissent); coup_progress += 1; coalition_dissent += 1 if historical_mode

We greatly reform old judicial protocols and laws bringing the new democracy to even furthest reaches of the goverment.

@minor_reforms
on-arrival: democratization += 1; workers_kcp += 3*(1-dissent) if democratization >= 3; judicial_reform += 1; pro_republic += 3*(1-dissent); judiciary_timer += 6

We are slowly reforming the legal code.

@as_is
go-to: root
